{'symbol': 'AOS', 'date': '2022-06-08 18:00:00', 'title': 'A. O. SMITH ACQUIRES WATER TREATMENT SOLUTIONS PROVIDER ATLANTIC FILTER CORPORATION', 'text': 'MILWAUKEE , JUNE 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WATER TECHNOLOGY COMPANY A. O. SMITH CORPORATION (NYSE: AOS) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT ACQUIRED ATLANTIC FILTER CORPORATION, A FLORIDA-BASED WATER TREATMENT COMPANY IN AN ALL-CASH TRANSACTION.'}